# Morph Extension Patch: AbyssalCraft
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_acid_spit=Acid Spit: Launches a highly corrosive shoggoth acid projectile, damaging armor and applying lingering acid damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shoggoth_ooze=Ooze Burst: Discharges a massive wave of strong acid slime, crippling nearby foes with severe slowness and weakness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_charge=Dread Charge: Hurls an explosive dread energy charge that explodes violently and spreads the Dread Plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_slug=Dread Slug: Fires a rapid armor-piercing dread slug projectile, inflicting Dread Plague upon impact.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_barrage=Dread Barrage: Discharges a concentrated salvo of three dread charges towards your crosshairs.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_slam=Dread Slam: Slams the ground with devastating dread shockwaves, launching and damaging surrounding entities.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_spectral_fireball=Spectral Fireball: Unleashes an eldritch wither breath fireball, creating an explosion that inflicts wither curse.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_ghoul_pounce=Ghoul Pounce: Lunges aggressively forward to tear into the prey, inflicting bleeding, hunger, and slowness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_coralium_squirt=Coralium Ink Squirt: Blasts venomous coralium ink, blinding targets and infecting them with coralium plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_remnant_screech=Remnant Screech: Shrieks an ancient aklo incantation, afflicting surrounding hostiles with slowness and weakness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_veil=Shadow Veil: Merges seamlessly with the darkness, granting brief invisibility and enhanced speed.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_collapse=Shadow Collapse: Generates a shadow gravity field, dragging nearby entities toward you with shadow damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_implosion=Anti Implosion: Triggers a localized antimatter collapse, detonating the surroundings with void annihilation.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_oblivion=Oblivion Singularity: Manifests an Omothol void singularity, crushing foes with wither and void damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_roar=Dread Roar: Unleashes a terrifying dread roar that rattles surrounding enemies with fear, weakness, and plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_step=Shadow Step: Steps through shadows to blink several blocks forward, bypassing obstacles.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_acid_melt=Acid Melt: Sprays caustic acid mist in a forward cone, dissolving enemy armor and reducing mobility.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_matter_blast=Antimatter Blast: Unleashes a piercing beam of pure antimatter energy, annihilating all entities in its path.

# Native Boss Mechanism Adapter Actions
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_wither_salvo=Ancient Wither Salvo: Swings the floating staff and fires a three-headed volley of wither skulls (middle head has a chance to shoot a blue invulnerable skull) guided by crosshair targeting.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_shout_blast=The Shout Blast: Shouts "...mglagln!" unleashing 1,000 explosive particles in a cone, blasting enemies within 48 blocks with devastating wall-slam shockwave!
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_singularity=Void Oblivion: Manifests an Omothol singularity at crosshair point. Regular cast summons an Entity Implosion ("Nilgh'ri mtli!"); Sneak cast summons an Entity Black Hole ("Ph'nilgh'ri n'ghft!").
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_earthquake=Omothol Earthquake: Chants "Shugnah throd!" triggering a 64-block seismic tremor with lava eruptions, severe nausea, and crippling slowness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_sacthoth_shadow_flame=Shadow Flame Breath: Spews thick dark shadow flames from the mouth, inflicting pure shadow damage, blindness, and slowness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_sacthoth_shadow_step=Tactical Shadow Step: Disintegrates into 128 large smoke particles and teleports instantly to the crosshair destination safely.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_chagaroth_dread_salvo=Dread Mother Salvo: Three heads unleash a barrage of high-speed dread slugs, explosive dread charges, and summoned dread beasts riding slugs!
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dragon_boss_breath=Dread Dragon Breath: Roars and launches a spread of 3 dread fireballs engulfing the forward area in dread flames.
